#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:4
msgid "About TradeFlow Colón — Wholesale Marketplace of the Americas"
msgstr "TradeFlow Colón — Marketplace mayorista"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:5
msgid ""
"Learn why buyers and suppliers choose TradeFlow Colón — the B2B marketplace "
"for the Colón Free Zone with verified companies, RFQ workflows, and export-"
"ready documentation."
msgstr ""
"Descubre por qué compradores y proveedores eligen TradeFlow Colón: el "
"marketplace B2B de la Zona Libre de Colón con empresas verificadas, fl"
"ujos RFQ y documentación lista para exportar."

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:16
msgid "Built for wholesale · Powered by the Free Zone"
msgstr "Hecho para mayoristas · Impulsado por la Zona Libre"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:17
msgid "Wholesale trade shouldn't require a flight to Panama"
msgstr "El comercio mayorista no debería exigir un vuelo a Panamá"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:18
msgid ""
"TradeFlow Colón connects international buyers with verified Colón Free Zone "
"suppliers — live inventory, transparent MOQs, and quote-first workflows "
"designed for real B2B orders."
msgstr ""
"TradeFlow Colón conecta compradores internacionales con proveedores ve"
"rificados de la Zona Libre de Colón: inventario activo, MOQ transparen"
"tes y flujos de cotización primero diseñados para pedidos B2B reales."

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:20
msgid "Join as a buyer — it's free"
msgstr "Únete como comprador — es gratis"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:21
msgid "Browse without signing up"
msgstr "Explorar sin registrarte"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:24
msgid "Platform reach"
msgstr "Destacados de la plataforma"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:25
msgid "Products live now"
msgstr "Diapositivas de productos"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:26
msgid "Verified CFZ companies"
msgstr "Socios verificados"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:27
msgid "Countries served"
msgstr "Países atendidos"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:31
msgid "Why buyers trust TradeFlow"
msgstr "Por qué TradeFlow"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:32
msgid "Trusted by importers, distributors & wholesale buyers"
msgstr "Con la confianza de importadores, distribuidores y compradores mayoristas"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:34
msgid "Quote before you commit"
msgstr "Cotiza antes de comprar"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:35
msgid "CFZ RUC verification on every supplier"
msgstr "Proveedores verificados ZLC"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:36
msgid "USD pricing & MOQ on every listing"
msgstr "Precios en USD y MOQ en cada listado"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:37
msgid "Invoice & packing list support"
msgstr "Soporte de factura y packing list"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:41
msgid "About sections"
msgstr "Secciones acerca de"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:42
#: templates/core/includes/home_join_band.html:12
msgid "Why TradeFlow"
msgstr "Por qué TradeFlow"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:43
msgid "Buyer protection"
msgstr "Protección al comprador"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:44
msgid "Sell with us"
msgstr "Vende con nosotros"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:45
msgid "The Free Zone"
msgstr "Zona Libre de Colón"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:50
msgid "We digitized the world's second-largest free trade zone"
msgstr "Digitalizamos la segunda zona franca más grande del mundo"

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:51
msgid ""
"For decades, sourcing from the Colón Free Zone meant phone calls, "
"spreadsheets, and uncertainty. TradeFlow puts verified catalogs, live stock, "
"and structured RFQs in one place — so you can compare suppliers, negotiate "
"volume, and place export-ready orders from anywhere."
msgstr ""
"Durante décadas, abastecerse desde la Zona Libre de Colón significó ll"
"amadas, hojas de cálculo e incertidumbre. TradeFlow reúne catálogos ve"
"rificados, stock activo y RFQ estructurados en un solo lugar para comp"
"arar proveedores, negociar volumen y hacer pedidos listos para exporta"
"r desde cualquier sitio."

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:52
msgid ""
"Whether you're an importer in Miami, a distributor in Bogotá, or a retailer "
"scaling across Central America — TradeFlow is your direct line to CFZ "
"wholesale."
msgstr ""
"Ya seas importador en Miami, distribuidor en Bogotá o retailer expandi"
"éndote en Centroamérica, TradeFlow es tu línea directa al mayorista ZL"
"C."

#: templates/core/acerca_tradeflow.html:53
msgid "Start browsing the catalog"
msgstr "Explora el catálogo"

